      "title": "Cigna Q3 Earnings Top Estimates on Cigna Healthcare Strength",
      "summary": "Cigna Group reported Q3 2026 adjusted EPS of $7.98, beating estimates by 7%, with revenues growing 6.1% to $73.8B. Cigna Healthcare segment showed strong performance with 8.9% revenue growth and 14.9% operating income growth. The company raised its 2026 adjusted EPS outlook to at least $30.60 and Cigna Healthcare's operating income target to $4.6B. However, Evernorth Health Services missed revenue estimates and Pharmacy Benefit Services contributed less than expected.",
